---
// Site-wide closure notice. Liv closed to new signups in August 2026 and the
// platform shuts down on 26 September 2026; this strip is pinned above the nav
// on every page so no visitor reads the marketing copy without the context.
---
<div class="shutdown-banner">
  <p>
    <span class="sb-long">Liv is closed to new signups and shuts down on 26 September 2026.</span>
    <span class="sb-short">Liv shuts down 26 Sep 2026.</span>
    <a href="/shutdown">read the notice &rarr;</a>
  </p>
</div>

<style>
  .shutdown-banner {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    z-index: 200;
    height: var(--banner-h, 44px);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 0 16px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.16), rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.16));
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.28);
    backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
  }

  .shutdown-banner p {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--text, #e0e0e8);
  }

  .shutdown-banner a {
    color: var(--amber, #fbbf24);
    white-space: nowrap;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .shutdown-banner a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

  .sb-short { display: none; }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .shutdown-banner p { font-size: 0.72rem; }
    .sb-long { display: none; }
    .sb-short { display: inline; }
  }
</style>
